You think you're so smart.

354
00:16:03,870 --> 00:16:07,060
你们觉得我会再上一次当  对吧
You think I'm going to fall for it again, don't you?

355
00:16:08,250 --> 00:16:09,830
我才不会
Well, I won't.

356
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,340
你要去哪
Where you going?

357
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,690
闭嘴
Shut up.

358
00:16:16,390 --> 00:16:19,690
你真的不能去吗
Aw, are you sure you can't come?

359
00:16:19,690 --> 00:16:22,740
我很想去  但我病得太严重了
I want to, but I'm just too sick.

360
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:26,220
可你真的很想见他
And you really wanted to meet him.

361
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:26,750
就是啊
I know.

362
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,870
我一直试着隐瞒病情好去见他
And I've been trying to hide it so I could go,

363
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:30,470
但我不想传染给他
but I don't want to make him sick.

364
00:16:30,470 --> 00:16:31,760
是呢
Yeah.

365
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:36,120
你看起来确实挺苍白虚弱
Yeah, you do look pretty pale and clammy.

366
00:16:40,450 --> 00:16:41,800
是啊
Yeah.

367
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:44,180
玩得开心
Have fun.

368
00:16:44,190 --> 00:16:46,270
你快点好起来  好吗
Well, feel better, okay?

369
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:56,370
就只是我平常版的苍白病君子样啊
No, that's just my regular pale and clammy.

370
00:16:58,770 --> 00:17:01,750
真的  最大的危机不是质量减少
I mean, really, the bigger danger isn't the loss of mass.

371
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:04,660
而是太阳会耗尽用作核燃料的氢
Instead, it will run out of hydrogen to use for nuclear fuel,

372
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:07,870
膨胀变成一个红巨星  把地球吞没
swell up into a red giant, and fry the Earth.

373
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:11,720
所以你不想分吃一份沙拉吗
So you don't want to split a salad?

374
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:12,760
不了  谢谢
No, thank you.

375
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,250
说到分开
But speaking of splitting things,

376
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:16,330
你听说过能提高光合作用效率的
did you hear about the light-splitting greenhouse film

377
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:19,090
分光温室棚膜吗
that could improve photosynthetic efficiency?

378
00:17:19,090 --> 00:17:20,720
没有
No.

379
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:22,670
是我在给我制造的人类
Just a little something I read

380
00:17:22,670 --> 00:17:25,400
喂奶时读到的小知识
while nursing a human being that I made.

381
00:17:27,630 --> 00:17:28,800
我还是点鸡肉吧
I'm just gonna get the chicken.

382
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:31,820
"鸟又"  鸡反过来的写法
Ah. N-E-K-C-I-H-C: chicken backwards.

383
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,910
屌炸  妈妈大脑
Boom, mom brain.

384
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:38,580
再加一整瓶红酒
And a whole bottle of wine.

385
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:44,030
吃屎吧
In your face!

386
00:17:50,950 --> 00:17:52,310
喂
Hello?

387
00:17:53,730 --> 00:17:55,820
亲爱的  你感觉怎么样
Aw, hey, sweetie, how you feeling?

388
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:58,090
还行  我在休息
Okay. I'm just resting.

389
00:17:58,100 --> 00:18:00,970
我有个惊喜也许能让你感觉好些
Well, I have a surprise that might make you feel better.

390
00:18:00,970 --> 00:18:01,780
真的吗
Oh, really?

391
00:18:01,780 --> 00:18:03,950
嗯  看这是谁呀
Yeah, look who's here.

392
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,420
等等  我认识你
Wait, I know you.

393
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,500
你不认识我
No, you don't.

394
00:18:13,950 --> 00:18:14,890
我真的认识
Yes, I do.

395
00:18:14,890 --> 00:18:17,930
你之前在我酒店楼下等我
You were waiting for me at my hotel.

396
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:20,290
你毁了我的领带
You ruined my tie.

397
00:18:21,010 --> 00:18:21,540
等等  什么
Wait, what?

398
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:22,690
他在说什么
What's he talking about?

399
00:18:22,690 --> 00:18:26,860
他很明显是在开玩笑啦
Uh, he, uh-- obviously, he's kidding.

400
00:18:26,860 --> 00:18:28,260
这笑话真逗  比尔
That's a, that's a good one, Bill.

401
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:29,710
我先挂了
I got to go.

402
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:34,990
蠢人莱纳德
Stupid Leonard,

403
00:18:35,390 --> 00:18:38,010
见蠢人比尔·盖茨
meeting stupid Bill Gates,

404
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:41,170
不带上蠢蠢的我
without stupid me.

405
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:44,440
对不起

406
00:18:51,700 --> 00:18:54,250
对不起...谢尔顿
I am so sorry-- Sheldon?

407
00:18:55,080 --> 00:18:58,200
莱纳德  我怎么忍心一直生你气
Oh, Leonard, I can't stay mad at you.

408
00:18:58,350 --> 00:18:59,840
过来
Come here.

409
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:02,030
我接受你的道歉
Apology accepted.

410
00:19:02,450 --> 00:19:04,620
晚饭吃什么  我快饿死了
What's for dinner? I'm starving.

411
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,670
"雷猴"
Hola.

412
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:19,340
又是这家伙

413
00:19:20,890 --> 00:19:23,350
他哪根筋抽了

414
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:25,610
女士们好吗
How are you ladies doing?

415
00:19:25,610 --> 00:19:28,010
"猴"就举一下手啊
Raise your hands if you're bueno.

416
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:35,470
谁会把孩子交给他照看啊

417
00:19:37,370 --> 00:19:38,960
孩子可能是他偷来的

418
00:19:40,380 --> 00:19:43,180
我系斯图尔特·布鲁姆呀
Me llamo Stuart Bloom.

419
00:19:44,510 --> 00:19:46,050
快写下来

420
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:49,250
我们可能要报告给警察

